abstract: "SPAC (Session-bound Path Authentication Chain) binds device identities, ordered hop records, registered shard claims, and cross-hop encoded-activation continuity into one verifiable proof for distributed neural inference, defending against proxy-model substitution and topology-tampering attacks."
